                    "line": 123,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Vernon Mauery",
                        "email": "vernon.mauery@gmail.com",
                        "username": "vmauery"
                    },
                    "message": "while we are at it, we can change these two uint8_t into a uint16_t\n\nAlthough, I would prefer if we just got rid of this struct and use the variables individually as needed."
                },
                {
                    "file": "sensorhandler.hpp",
